# Project Engineering

- Prefer simple, reviewable changes that support the take-home brief directly.
- Keep implementation decisions explainable to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.
- Do not add speculative architecture, background services, or abstractions without a concrete need.
- Preserve deterministic portfolio outputs so tests, screenshots, and debrief discussion stay stable.
- After AI-assisted edits, verify the result with relevant tests, linting, and a manual read-through.
- Document assumptions clearly when the brief intentionally leaves details open.
